{"path":"\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/' data-target='root' data-title=''>&#8962; <\/a>\r\n\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer' data-target='computer' data-title='Computer'>\r\n\t\t\tComputer\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer\/os' data-target='computer\/os' data-title='OS'>\r\n\t\t\tOS\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer\/os\/nix' data-target='computer\/os\/nix' data-title='*Nix'>\r\n\t\t\t*Nix\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer\/os\/nix\/custom' data-target='computer\/os\/nix\/custom' data-title='Custom'>\r\n\t\t\tCustom\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n","async":"0","desc":"Override ssh with a wrapper that sets Terminal background colour from the remote hostname.","label":"SSH colour","prevArticle":null,"nextArticle":null,"languageSwitcher":"<div id='language-switcher'>\n<\/div>\n","content":"<div id='message'>\n\t<p>\n\t\tOverride the <code class='inline'>ssh<\/code> command so the terminal background colour changes with the host you connect to.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h2>Install<\/h2>\n\t<p>\n\t\tPlace <code class='inline'>ssh<\/code> in <code class='inline'>~\/.bin\/<\/code>. Make it executable. Prepend <code class='inline'>~\/.bin\/<\/code> to <code class='inline'>PATH<\/code>.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>chmod +x ssh<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<h2>Wrapper<\/h2>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>#!\/bin\/sh\n\n\nHOSTNAME=`echo $@ | sed s\/.*@\/\/`\n\n\nset_bg () {\n  osascript -e \"tell application \\\"Terminal\\\" to set background color of window 1 to $1\"\n}\n\n\non_exit () {\n  set_bg \"{25000, 0, 0, 50000}\"\n}\ntrap on_exit EXIT\n\n\ncase $HOSTNAME in\n  prod.&lt;domain&gt;.com) set_bg \"{45000, 0, 0, 50000}\" ;;\n  stage.&lt;domain&gt;.com) set_bg \"{25000, 0, 0, 50000}\" ;;\n  dev.&lt;domain&gt;.com) set_bg \"{15000, 0, 0, 50000}\" ;;\n*) set_bg \"{0, 45000, 0, 50000}\" ;;\nesac\n\n\n\/usr\/bin\/ssh \"$@\"<\/code><\/pre>\n<\/div>\n\n<div id='updated-container'>\r\n\t<div id='updated'>\r\n\t\tUpdated:\r\n\t\t<span id='date'>\r\n\t\t\t2026 Aug 19\t\t<\/span>\r\n\t<\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<div class='center' id='content-body-separator'><\/div>\r\n<div id='sub-list' class='center page-list'>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<div id='fb_components'>\r\n\t<div class=\"fb-comments\"\n  data-href=\"https:\/\/ujnotes.com\/computer\/os\/nix\/custom\/server_ssh_colour_change\"\n  data-numposts=\"50\">\n<\/div>\n\t<div class=\"fb-like\"\n  data-href=\"https:\/\/ujnotes.com\/computer\/os\/nix\/custom\/server_ssh_colour_change\"\n  data-layout=\"button\"\n  data-action=\"like\"\n  data-size=\"small\"\n  data-show-faces=\"false\"\n  data-share=\"true\">\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\r\n<div id='nav-list' class='center page-list'>\r\n\t<a id='nav-menu-prev'\r\n\t\t\tclass='item_block-disabled sidebar-nav-norm sidebar-nav-l-1' >\r\n\t\t&nbsp;\r\n\t\t<\/a><a id='nav-menu-next'\r\n\t\t\tclass='item_block-disabled sidebar-nav-norm sidebar-nav-l-1' >\r\n\t\t&nbsp;\r\n\t\t<\/a><a id='nav-menu-up' class='XURL item_block_container ' href='\/computer\/os\/nix\/custom' data-target='computer\/os\/nix\/custom' data-title='Custom'>\r\n\t\t<img class='item_block_image ' loading='lazy' src='\/resource\/placeholder.svg ' alt='Navigation - up level tile'><div class='item_block_text'><div>Custom<\/div><div class='arrow'>&#x25B2;<\/div><\/div>\r\n\t<\/a> <\/div>\r\n"}